WEBVTT

00:07:30.237 --> 00:07:31.572
I'll help you.

00:07:31.614 --> 00:07:35.701
It goes something like,
(sings) Ooh, dream weaver.

00:07:35.701 --> 00:07:37.119
(Laughter)

00:07:37.119 --> 00:07:38.704
Oh, sorry --

00:07:38.746 --> 00:07:40.164
(Applause)

00:07:40.206 --> 00:07:41.707
I just had to sing it

00:07:41.749 --> 00:07:44.251
because that song is actually
pretty important to me,

00:07:44.251 --> 00:07:46.420
it was playing the first time
I kissed a girl.

00:07:46.462 --> 00:07:49.965
It will now be stuck in your head
for the rest of the day, you're welcome.

00:07:50.299 --> 00:07:52.343
And with the addition of that position,

00:07:52.343 --> 00:07:53.886
we were on fire.

00:07:54.512 --> 00:07:57.223
Sincerely, a guest warned us in advance

00:07:57.223 --> 00:08:00.559
that his dad was more of a Budweiser
steak-and-potatoes kind of guy